WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Opposite signs of the orbital amplitude meet at a node.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Reverse both signs together. The node and amplitude magnitude stay the same.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Squaring the amplitude gives the same nonnegative one-orbital density.
